****
301  Modem Programs
301  -KAYFUN .301 - This disk originally MICRO CORNUCOPIA Disk K1.
301  DISK-301.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
301  MODEMPAT.COM - Sets up the baud rate, bits per character, stop bits,
301  MODEMPAT.ASM -   and parity for the serial port.
301  MODEM7  .COM - MODEM 7 configured for the Kaypro.  You use MODEMPAT,
301  MODEM7  .DOC -   above, before you enter this version of MODEM 7.
301  MODEM7+ .COM - MODEM 7 with MODEMPAT grafted onto it.
301  KMDM795 .COM - A superset of MODEM 7.  Lets you set the baud rate on
301  KMDM795 .DOC -   the fly.  But does not perform any of MODEMPAT's
301               -   functions.
301  KMDM795 .LIB - A macro library.
301  KMDM795 .AQM - Squeezed source of KMDM795.COM.
301  SQ      .COM - Squeezes files for tight storage and fast transmission.
301  USQ     .COM - Unsqueezes files.
301  SQ/USQ  .DOC -
301  FLS     .COM - Command line expander for SQ and USQ.
301  TERM    .MAC - A commented disassembly of the TERM program that comes
301               -   with the Kaypro.
301  D       .COM - Produces a sorted directory with file sizes.
301  TERM    .DOC - Information on controlling the Kaypro screen.
****
302  Utilities
302  -KAYFUN .302 - This disk originally MICRO CORNUCOPIA Disk K2.
302  DISK-302.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
302  FORMFEED.COM - Outputs a form feed to the LST: device.
302  FORMFEED.DOC -
302  DIR-DUMP.COM - Displays the names of all the disk files, their user
302               -   areas and locations on the disk.
302  UNERA   .COM - Unerases files.
302  UNERA   .DOC -
302  D       .COM - Produces a sorted directory with file sizes.
302  D       .DOC -
302  WASH    .COM - File moving and maintenance utility.
302  DUMPX   .COM - Extended DUMP utility.  Faster.  Displays ASCII
302  DUMPX   .DOC -   equivalents.
302  SUPERSUB.COM - An improvement over CP/M's submit.
302  SUPERSUB.DOC -
302  ALLOC   .COM - Produces a bit map of disk, write-protects files.  Menu
302               -   driven.
302  COMPARE .COM - Checks one file against another.
302  DU      .COM - A powerful, useful disk editor.  Version 7.7.
302  DU      .DOC -
302  LISTT   .COM - Prints out files with headers, page #'s and offset from
302  LISTT   .DOC -   left margin.
302  WCOUNT  .COM - Counts words in text files.  Must have bugs, because
302  WCOUNT  .DOC -   it counts wrong.
302  ZESOURCE.COM - Zilog format disassembler.  This is an update of the
302  ZESOURCE.DOC -   famous RESOURCE.
302  UNSPOOL .COM - Prints out data while allowing you to use the computer
302  UNSPOOL .DOC -   at the same time.
302  UN      .COM - Unlocks "protected" MBASIC programs
302  UN      .DOC -
302  FINDBD54.COM - Finds and locks out bad sectors on a disk.
302  FINDBD54.DOC -
302  @       .COM - An on-line calculator.
302  @       .DOC -
302  FIX     .COM - A verbose disk editor.  Different from DU.
302  FIX     .DOC -
302  DIRCHK  .COM - Checks the data on a disk directory.
302  DIRCHK  .DOC -
302  UNLOAD  .COM - Turns a .COM file into a .HEX file.
302  CATALOG2.DOC - This group of programs creates and maintains a
302  CAT2    .COM -   directory of all the files you have on all your
302  UCAT    .COM -   disks.  You can display which disks contain certain
302  MAST    .CAT -   files or which files are on a certain disk etc. etc.
302  FMAP    .COM -
302  DIF2    .COM - With these you can update someone else's copy of a
302  SSED2   .COM -   program by simply creating a file of the updates
302  DIF/SSED.DOC -   (using DIF2) and sending the differences.  He would
302               -   then incorporate the differences (using SSED2) into
302               -   his file.  Saves on modem time.
****
303  Games
303  -KAYFUN .303 - This disk originally MICRO CORNUCOPIA Disk K3.
303  DISK-303.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
303  PACMAN  .COM - Pacman-type game.
303  PACMAN  .DOC -
303  ZCHESS  .COM - A Z80 chess game with a 1-6 level look-ahead.
303  ZCHESS  .DOC -
303  OTHELLO .COM - An excellent Othello game.
303  GAMES   .COM - A group of 7 games all put together as one program.
303  WUMPUS  .COM - WUMPUS, a classic computer game.
303  WUMPUS  .DOC -
303  WUMPUS  .PAS - Source for above in Pascal/Z.
303  CAVE0   .    - You have a choice of caves as you enter the game.
303  CAVE1   .    -   |
303  CAVE2   .    -   |
303  CAVE4   .    -   |
303  CAVE5   .    -   |
303  PRESSUP .COM - A game similar to Othello, but easier to master.
303  PRESSUP .C   - Source for above in BDS C.  Instructions are at the top
303               -   of this file
303  MM      .COM - The Master Mind game.
303  MM      .C   - Source for above in BDS C.
303  BIO     .COM - Generates biorhythm charts.
303  MAZE    .COM - Generates random mazes.
303  ADV-SAVE.DOC - Tells you how to run Disk K4's Adventure on a 191k
303               -   disk and still be able to save your games.
303  D       .COM - Produces a sorted directory with file sizes.
303  WASH    .COM - File moving and maintenance utility.
