304  550 Point Adventure game
304  -KAYFUN .304 - This disk originally MICRO CORNUCOPIA Disk K4.
304  ADV     .COM - This is the latest, greatest, most cussed adventure
304  ADVI    .DAT -   ever devised by half-mortals.  This cave is greatly
304  ADVI    .PTR -   expanded and the creatures are much smarter.  These
304  ADVT    .DAT -   files total 191k so there isn't room for the usual
304  ADVT    .PTR -   documentation files.
