315  Hard Disk Utilities
315  -KAYFUN .315 - This disk originally MICRO CORNUCOPIA Disk K15.
315  DISK-315.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
315  BACKUP  .COM - Allows you to back-up your hard disk on as many floppy
315  BACKUP  .DOC -   disks as are necessary.  Performs many organizational
315  BACKUP  .ASM -   functions as it does so.
315  FLOPCOPY.COM - Copies one floppy disk to another using the hard disk
315  FLOPCOPY.DOC -   as a buffer.  Detects disk-full condition so that
315  FLOPCOPY.ASM -   you can copy a DS/DD disk onto two SS/DD disks.
315  BIGBURST.COM - Allows you to back-up a file from the hard disk onto
315  BIGBURST.DOC -   a floppy disk even if it is too large to fit on one
315  BIGBURST.ASM -   floppy.  It then allows you to easily put it back
315               -   together when you copy it back to the hard disk.
315  MULTCOPY.COM - Operates similar to PIP, but will prompt you when the
315  MULTCOPY.DOC -   floppy is full to change floppies.
315  MULTCOPY.ASM -
315  MDIR    .COM - Displays a directory of files in all user areas.
315  MDIR    .ASM -
315  MOVE    .COM - Moves a file from current user area to another user
315               -   area.
315  MAKE    .COM - Moves a file from any user area to any other user area.
315  U       .COM - Allows you to change user area and drive with one
315  U       .ASM -   command.
315  SWEEP   .COM - A file moving and maintenance utility.
315  SWEEP38 .DOC -
315  D       .COM - Produces a sorted directory with file sizes.
315  UNSQ    .COM - Unsqueezes files.  This version lets you use ambiguous
315               -         file names.
