321  SBASIC Programs and Screen Dump
321  -KAYFUN .321 - This disk originally MICRO CORNUCOPIA Disk K21.
321  DISK-321.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
321  DIR+    .COM - A file moving and maintenance utility.
321  DIR+    .DOC -
321  DRIVER  .COM - Creates a menu of .COM files on drives A and B and
321  DRIVER  .DOC -   executes selected file.
321  DRIVER  .BAS - Source for above in SBASIC.
321  DUMP24  .COM - Screen to printer dump for older Kaypros.
321  DUMP24  .DOC -
321  DUMP24  .MAC -
321  DUMP10  .COM - Same as above, but this version is for '84 models.
321  DUMP484 .COM -   Dumps ASCII characters only, but the source is here
321  DUMP1084.DOC -   for those who want to try to make it dump graphics
321  DUMP1084.MAC -   as well.
321  HANGMAN .COM - Traditional word guessing game.  Very fancy.  You can
321  HANGMAN .DOC -   set up your own word list.
321  WORD    .COM - Word library of Hangman.  Allows for updating of
321  WORD    .LIB -   library, but make sure you read the note in
321               -   HANGMAN.DOC.
321  INSCREEN.COM - SBASIC screen input program.  Good program to learn
321  INSCREEN.DOC -   basics of SBASIC.
321  INSCREEN.BAS -
321  MATH    .COM - Micro C's structured recoding of Math1 below.  This was
321  MATH    .DOC -   done to demonstrate the increased readability of
321  MATH    .BAS -   structured SBASIC programming.
321  MATH1   .COM - The math game as Micro C originally received it.
321  MATH1   .BAS -   Unstructured.
321  MSTRMIND.COM - Mastermind game in SBASIC.
321  MSTRMIND.DOC -
321  MSTRMIND.BAS -
321  SCREEN  .COM - SBASIC program that displays all displayable screen
