504  MDM740, and Telecommunications Info
504  This disk contains MDM740 WITH ITS OVERLAYS so that you may customize
504  and/or experiment with it.  Note: This version of MDM740 does not
504  support Kaypro internal modems at the present time.
504  DISK-504.DOC - A description of the files on this disk.
504  M7KAYPRO.DOC - How to use the two .SUB file on this disk.
504  MDM740  .COM - An unconfigured version of the MDM740
504               -   telecommunications program.  Won't run on Kaypros
504               -   until overlay MDM711KP.ASM is installed.  Read
504               -   M7KAYPRO.DOC.
504  MDM711KP.ASM - The Kaypro overlay file used to configure MDM740.COM
504               -   for the Kaypro.  This file can be easily modified so
504               -   as to make MDM740 suit your specific needs.
504  MDM740KP.SUB - Automatically installs the above overlay file into
504               -   MDM740.COM to make the Kaypro configured version,
504               -   MDM740KP.COM.  Read M7KAYPRO.DOC.
504  MDM740KP.COM - MDM740.COM configured for the Kaypro.
504  M7NM-6  .ASM - The MDM740 phone number library overlay.  This file can
504               -   be easily modfiied to suit your specific needs.
504               -   Install this after installing MDM711KP.ASM.
504  M7NM-6  .SUB - The submit file for automatically installing the above
504               -   into MDM740KP.COM.  Read M7KAYPRO.DOC.
504  MDM740  .DOC - Documentation on using MDM740.
504  MDM740  .INF -   |
504  M7FNK   .COM - Allows you to redefine the 10 function keys of MDM740.
504  M7FNK   .DOC -
504  M7FNK   .NOT -
504  M7LIB   .COM - Allows you to add to or modify the MDM740 phone number
504  M7LIB   .DOC -   library.
504  M7KPRO  .FIX - Info on patching a bug in the Kaypro 4's BIOS.
504  EX14    .COM - A fantastic replacement for SUBMIT.  Use with the .SUB
504               -   files on this disk.
504  HELP    .COM - The HELP system.  For use with .HLP files.  Just run
504               -   the program for on-line documentation.
504  XMODEM  .HLP - A HELP file on downloading from a bulletin board such
504               -   as KAY*FOG using XMODEM.  Usage: A>HELP XMODEM.
504  MDM-PROG.HLP - A HELP file about CP/M public domain modem programs.
504               -   Usage: A>HELP MDM-PROG.
504  PROTOCOL.DOC - Information on the XMODEM communications protocol.
504  TELECOMP.DOC - Info on what telecommunications is all about.
