521  IMP244 is a telecommunications program based on MDM740.  It adds
521  the new batch mode and 1k protocols currently in use on most bulletin
521  boards and the auto stepdown feature of most 2400 baud modems.  NOTE:
521  This version of IMP244 does not support Kaypro internal modems at the
521  present time.
521  DISK-521.DOC - Description of the files on this disk.
521  IMP244KP.COM - A pre-configured Kaypro version of IMP244.
521  IMP244  .COM - An unconfigured version of IMP244.  Will not run on
521               -   Kaypros until the overlay, I2KP-1.ASM is installed.
521  I2KP-1  .ASM - Kaypro overlay used to configure IMP244.COM for the
521               -   Kaypro.  This file can be easily modified with any
521               -   text editor to make IMP244 suit your specific needs.
521  I2NM-2  .ASM - Phone number library and function key overlay for
521               -   IMP244.  Put your own phone numbers and function keys
521               -   here with any text editor.
521  IMP244KP.SUB - Submit file for automatically installing the above 2
521               -   overlays into IMP244.COM.
521  IMP-OVL .CUS - Notes on how to customize and install the overlays
521  READ    .ME  -   I2KP-1.ASM and I2NM-2.ASM.
521  EX14    .COM - Replacement for submit.  Use with IMP244KP.SUB above.
521  IMP     .DOC - Documentation for IMP244.
521  NOTE         -   |
521  IMP-NEW .INF -   |
521  NEW          -   |
521  IMP-DISK.NOT - Note on file transfers for floppy based systems.
521  IMP-OVL .LST - List of current overlays for IMP244.
521  I2LIB   .COM - Allows you to add to or modify the IMP244 phone number
521  I2LIB   .DOC -   library.
521  I2FUNC  .COM - Allows you to redefine the 10 function keys of IMP244.
521  I2FUNC  .DOC -
521  KMD     .INF - A discussion of KMD (the new XMODEM) and the 1k file
521               -   transfer protocol.
521  MLOAD24 .COM - A linking, relocating loader used here to install the
521  MLOAD21 .DOC -   overlays, I2NM-2.ASM and I2KP-1.ASM into IMP244.COM.
521  SQ111   .COM - Squeezes files for tight storage and fast transmission
521  SQ111   .DOC -   over telephone lines.
521  USQ120  .COM - Unsqueezes squeezed files.
521  USQ     .DOC -   3k
