522               -   Kaypros until the overlay file MXO-KP42.ASM is
522               -   installed.
522  MXO-KP42.AQM - The Kaypro overlay file used to configure MEX114.COM
522               -   for the Kaypro.  This file can be easily modified to
522               -   make MEX114 suit your specific needs.
522  MEXPAT22.AQM - Patch overlay file for MEX114.  You can edit this file
522               -   to change various initial variables within the
522               -   program.
522  MEX114KP.SUB - Submit file for automatically installing the above 2
522               -   overlays into MEX114.COM
