701  IMP244 for C128 commodore
701  IMP244 is a telecommunications program based on MDM740.  It adds
701  the new batch mode and 1k protocols currently in use on most bulletin
701  boards and the auto stepdown feature of most 2400 baud modems.
701  DISK-701.DOC - Description of the files on this disk.
701  C128-NEW.DOC - How to copy, transfer and install all these files.
701  C128-NEW.IRV - Documentation file discussing C-128 and IMP.
701  64CONVRT.    - Converts the following two files to CP/M.
701  NEWSYS  .COM - Replacement for original CPM+.SYS file.
701  IMP-C128.COM - A pre-configured C-128 version of IMP244.
701  IMP244  .COM - An unconfigured version of IMP244.  Will not run on
701               -   C128s until the overlay, I2C8-1.ASM is installed.
701  IMP     .DOC - Documentation for IMP244 and IMP-C128.
701  I2C8-1  .ASM - Overlay used to reconfigure IMP-C128.COM, if need be.
701  I2NM-2  .ASM - Phone number library and function key overlay for
701               -   IMP244.  Put your own phone numbers and function keys
701               -   here with any text editor.
701  READ    .ME  - How to change and install I2C8-1.ASM and I2NM-2.ASM
701               -   files.
701  IMP-C128.SUB - Submit file for automatically installing the above two
701               -   ASM overlay files into IMP244.COM (see READ.ME).
701  EX14    .COM - Replacement for submit.  Use with IMP-C128.SUB above.
701  EX14    .DOC -
701  MLOAD   .COM - A linking, relocating loader used here to install the
701  MLOAD21 .DOC -   overlays, I2NM-2.ASM and I2C8-1.ASM into IMP244.COM.
701               -   Taken care of by IMP-C128.SUB.
701  I2FUNC  .COM - Allows you to redefine the 10 function keys of IMP244.
701  I2FUNC  .DOC -
701  I2LIB   .COM - Allows you to add to or modify the IMP244 phone number
701  I2LIB   .DOC -   library.
****
